# Just do it

- Implement what the user asked. Do not analyze, over-explain, or explore beyond what is needed to make the change.
- The user verifies the work. Do not open the browser, take screenshots, or run UI verification unless they explicitly ask.
- Do not attach screenshots of implemented work unless they ask.
